<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BOMBAY, Sept 6 - Berthing position at Jawaharlal Nehru - delays - containers three to four days and bulk cargo nine to 11 days.</p>
